LICENSING UNDECIDED — PLACEHOLDER

No licence has been chosen for this repository yet. Until one is, default copyright applies:
all rights reserved by the author, and no permission to use, copy, modify or distribute is
granted.

This is a deliberate placeholder, not an oversight. The choice depends on unresolved questions
(internal-only vs. published tool; whether institutional policy constrains it; whether any
dependency imposes a copyleft obligation). It is tracked as an open grilling question.

Note on dependencies: this project draws on external scientific datasets (Ensembl, NCBI GEO,
ENCODE) whose own terms must be reviewed before any redistribution of derived data.
